  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Talons",
    "summary": "Aura. In the Battle-shock step of the opposing player's Command phase, each enemy unit that is under its Starting Strength and within 12\" of any HERETIC ASTARTES unit of yours has to take a Battle-shock test. Any Battle-shock test taken by an enemy unit while it is within 12\" of any of your HERETIC ASTARTES units has 1 subtracted from its result. An enemy unit this rule has affected need not take further Battle-shock tests in that phase.",
